  "commit_message": "docs: adopt and publish reviewed ORE N0 repository integration C1\n\nAdopt exactly the 37 reviewed additions of ORE-N0-REPOSITORY-INTEGRATION-C1.\nCanonical delta SHA-256: 2e64bc07720a8e91b387724704d44860ee9a16fb5d5e364b46c11c5f97c12b1b.\nIndependent integration review: RR-ORE-N0-REPOSITORY-INTEGRATION-C1-PASS.\n\nThis commit records repository adoption/publication only. It does not\nestablish or activate N0. Independent publication verification and separate\nexternal activation authority remain required; T_N0 remains UNSET.\nCD prospectively dependency-eligible remains a documentary statement only.\nCD substantive work and prospective preflight remain blocked pending their\nseparate prerequisites. Historical U/FAIL/withdrawn findings are unchanged.\nUPSTREAM ORE COMPATIBILITY / DRIFT CONTROL = REQUIRED and UNSATISFIED.\nNo implementation, qualification, Execution Readiness or mining authority.\n\n",
